        <mxCell id="q1" value="1. What systems are mandatory systems of record?&lt;br&gt;- Work orders&lt;br&gt;- Fuel&lt;br&gt;- Compliance&lt;br&gt;- Asset inventory" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C1C7D0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#172B4D;align=left;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
