        <mxCell id="q3" value="3. What should phase-one success prove?&lt;br&gt;- Compliance automation&lt;br&gt;- Maintenance automation&lt;br&gt;- Live asset visibility&lt;br&gt;- Safety video&lt;br&gt;- Fuel tracking" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C1C7D0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#172B4D;align=left;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
